# Dellian's +2 on turn 1 (loyalty 7, Bot1 23) and -6 on turn 3 (loyalty 1) give Bot1 the emblem (CR 114.2). On turn 4 Bot2
# gains 5 with its own Witherbloom Charm: the emblem is Bot1's, so nothing triggers ("whenever YOU gain life"): Bot1 stays at
# 23. On turn 5 Bot1's +2 gains 3: the emblem's trigger targets Bot2, who loses that much, 3 (25 - 3 = 22), then Bot1's Charm
# gains 5 and Bot2 loses that much, 5 (22 - 5 = 17). Bot1 ends 23 + 3 + 5 = 31.

